  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Makerere journalist edu.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Makerere journalist utb.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet startade 2002 utifr&#xe5;n den f&#xf6;rsta Lake Victoria strategin som identifierade information och medias betydelse f&#xf6;r utvecklingen av regionen. Programmets huvudsyfte &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra kvaliten p&#xe5; milj&#xf6;journalistiken genom utbildning, n&#xe4;tverkande, f&#xe4;ltresor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme was initiated in 2002 based on the first Lake Victoria strategy identifying information and media as vital in the development of the region. The programme&apos;s main goal is to improve quality of environmental reporting through training, networking, community outreach and developing positive attitudes toward  sustainable management of resources through media.</narrative>
  </description>
